{"reviewId": "219871204_81AdUBDTZ", "review": {"abstract": "房地产作为一类资产的投资价值渐渐淡去之后，中国庞大的货币面临着方向的选择，我们当时就有一个判断，随着步入工业化后期，中国已经开始进入宏观对冲时代", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "老天奶，看到这里才领悟为什么前段时间黄金暴涨和现阶段铜涨价不都是用了宏观对冲的策略吗？人果然挣不到自己认知之外的钱。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "688-760", "createTime": 1752300014, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "219871204_81AdUBDTZ", "userVid": 219871204, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 219871204, "name": "番茄你个西红柿🍅", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-mHxEO8zMy9HpIC1FqKT0cf5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "番茄你个西红柿🍅", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "慢慢来，比较快", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-500", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 11, "likes": [{"userVid": 66456286, "name": "南煋胡", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-bLLoioAHzjjofn0Vo9tH6f9/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "爱财有道，好色有度，审美有术，致于极品。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20231030-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}], "commentsCount": 6, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "这就有点过了，黄金暴涨是因为美国人担心黄金受关税影响大量进口导致的。铜就更简单了，需求增长，产能有限。其他大宗商品都在跌。", "r